WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.282
Vinnie and Mandy followed Varius.

2
00:00:03.283 --> 00:00:07.629
They were walking down a road of large, flat stones.

3
00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:11.555
"Where is the forum?" asked Mandy.

4
00:00:11.556 --> 00:00:17.175
"On Palatine Hill, the oldest part of Rome," said Varius.

5
00:00:17.176 --> 00:00:21.143
"What is the forum?" Vinnie asked.

6
00:00:21.144 --> 00:00:27.267
"Look around," laughed Varius. "We’re here."

7
00:00:27.268 --> 00:00:31.809
They were in an area filled with people and stalls.

8
00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.876
Everything seemed to be for sale.

9
00:00:34.877 --> 00:00:39.068
"Would you like some figs?" asked one merchant.

10
00:00:39.069 --> 00:00:42.004
"Look!" said Varius.

11
00:00:42.005 --> 00:00:46.472
A toy seller held up a wooden horse with wings.

12
00:00:46.473 --> 00:00:51.556
"What’s happening there?" Vinnie said, pointing.

13
00:00:51.557 --> 00:00:57.402
People were standing in a big circle watching two men fight.

14
00:00:57.403 --> 00:01:00.813
The men held swords and shields.

15
00:01:00.814 --> 00:01:02.567
"I can’t look!"

16
00:01:02.568 --> 00:01:06.279
said Mandy, covering her eyes.

17
00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.517
Varius laughed.

18
00:01:09.518 --> 00:01:12.677
"They are gladiators!" he said.

19
00:01:12.678 --> 00:01:16.277
"Gladiators?" asked Vinnie.

20
00:01:16.278 --> 00:01:20.611
"Highly trained fighters," explained Varius.

21
00:01:20.612 --> 00:01:22.804
"They are just practicing now.

22
00:01:22.805 --> 00:01:25.817
But people pay to watch them fight."

23
00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:29.999
"Do they get hurt?" asked Mandy.

24
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.348
Varius laughed louder and said,

25
00:01:35.349 --> 00:01:38.042
"Gladiators fight to the death."

26
00:01:38.043 --> 00:01:41.467
Mandy’s face got very white.

27
00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:46.408
Vinnie and Mandy followed Varius through the forum.

28
00:01:46.409 --> 00:01:51.271
"Look at those buildings!" exclaimed Mandy.

29
00:01:51.272 --> 00:01:55.676
The forum was filled with temples and statues.

30
00:01:55.677 --> 00:02:00.537
"Septimus will be in the main office building," Varius said.

31
00:02:00.538 --> 00:02:04.601
"Most Roman officials work there," he added.

32
00:02:04.602 --> 00:02:07.676
They walked a little farther.

33
00:02:07.677 --> 00:02:11.019
"Here it is," said Varius.

34
00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:15.343
The children followed Varius into the building.

35
00:02:15.344 --> 00:02:18.756
Varius walked over to some men.

36
00:02:18.757 --> 00:02:23.003
One man smiled when he saw Varius.

37
00:02:23.004 --> 00:02:27.818
"Septimus, I am sorry to interrupt you," said Varius.

38
00:02:27.819 --> 00:02:33.267
"No problem!" laughed Septimus.

39
00:02:33.268 --> 00:02:36.749
Then he saw Varius’ worried face.

40
00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:39.073
"What is the matter?"

41
00:02:39.074 --> 00:02:45.202
Varius introduced the children and told him what Mandy had overheard.

42
00:02:45.203 --> 00:02:49.276
"Brutus is so jealous," said Septimus.

43
00:02:49.277 --> 00:02:52.740
"We cannot allow him to carry out his plan."

44
00:02:52.741 --> 00:02:58.428
"We’ll help," said Vinnie and Mandy at the same time.

45
00:02:58.429 --> 00:03:00.261
Septimus nodded.

46
00:03:00.262 --> 00:03:03.208
"I will find Aquila and warn him."

47
00:03:03.209 --> 00:03:06.021
Mandy’s cheeks grew red.

48
00:03:06.022 --> 00:03:10.821
"But what about the horses?" she yelled.

49
00:03:10.822 --> 00:03:15.481
"Tell Aquila’s stable boy to guard them carefully," he said.

50
00:03:15.482 --> 00:03:20.033
"And find Master Antonius," he said to Varius.

51
00:03:20.034 --> 00:03:22.299
"He will be supervising the race.

52
00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:26.537
Tell him this news. Go quickly!"

53
00:03:26.538 --> 00:03:31.059
Varius and the children headed to the stables.

54
00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:35.068
A boy carrying a bucket was hurrying by.

55
00:03:35.069 --> 00:03:37.602
Varius stopped him.

56
00:03:37.603 --> 00:03:42.102
"Where is Aquila’s stable boy?" Varius asked.

57
00:03:42.103 --> 00:03:45.876
"Young Melus?" replied the boy.

58
00:03:45.877 --> 00:03:48.487
"His mother became ill suddenly.

59
00:03:48.488 --> 00:03:50.748
He had to rush home."

60
00:03:50.749 --> 00:03:54.137
"Oh no!" cried Mandy.

61
00:03:54.138 --> 00:03:58.404
"No one is watching the horses!"

62
00:03:58.405 --> 00:04:02.353
"Where does Melus live?" said Vinnie.

63
00:04:02.354 --> 00:04:04.599
"His father is a butcher.

64
00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:06.318
You know where to look."

65
00:04:06.319 --> 00:04:08.686
The boy hurried away.

66
00:04:08.687 --> 00:04:12.000
"Come!" said Varius sharply.

67
00:04:12.001 --> 00:04:19.988
"Time is running out!"

